# Internacia-DB: Missing International Blocks — Gap Analysis Report

## Executive Summary

The [internacia-db](https://github.com/datenoio/internacia-db) repository currently catalogues **1,021 international blocks** across 84 unique blocktype categories. While the database is impressively broad — spanning everything from military alliances to rail gauges — this analysis identifies **three major categories of gaps**: (1) entirely absent high-priority organizations and groupings, (2) underdeveloped thematic domains with only 1–4 records each, and (3) structural issues in the taxonomy where 34 blocktypes are actively used in the data but are not defined in the `blocktypes.yaml` schema file.

