Note: The existing `BRICS` record already reflects the current 10-member configuration (including Egypt, Ethiopia, Iran, UAE, Indonesia). A separate `BRICSPLUS` entry tracking the expansion process and invited-but-declined members (Saudi Arabia) may aid historical tracking.

### 2.3 East Asian Regional Forums

The database has `ASEAN` but is missing its derivative frameworks, which are major fixtures in Asian diplomacy:

| Suggested ID | Name | Blocktype(s) | Founded | Members |
